<body class="rs-page" style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f3f4f6;color:#111827;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%"><div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;opacity:0;mso-hide:all">Here is what Rampsmith does next.</div>
<div role="article" aria-roledescription="email" aria-label="6 fixes approved for Example Outfitters" lang="en" dir="ltr" class="rs-page" style="background-color:#f3f4f6;color:#111827;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;padding:24px 12px"><!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" align="center" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto"><div class="rs-card" style="background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #d1d5db;border-radius:8px;padding:32px 24px"><p class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#111827;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.02em">Rampsmith</p>
<h1 class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:24px;line-height:32px;font-weight:700;color:#111827">6 fixes approved</h1>
<p class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#111827"><bdi>6</bdi> fixes for <bdi>Example Outfitters</bdi> were approved on <bdi>October 17, 2026</bdi>.</p>
<h2 class="rs-text" style="margin:24px 0 8px;font-size:18px;line-height:26px;font-weight:700;color:#111827">Approved fixes</h2>
<ul class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;padding:0 0 0 24px;color:#111827;font-size:16px;line-height:24px"><li style="margin:0 0 8px"><bdi>Add alt text to 12 product images</bdi> (WCAG <bdi>1.1.1</bdi>, <bdi>store data</bdi>)</li>
<li style="margin:0 0 8px"><bdi>Name the cart icon link</bdi> (WCAG <bdi>2.4.4</bdi>, <bdi>pull request</bdi>)</li>
</ul>
<p class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#111827">And <bdi>4</bdi> more.</p>
<h2 class="rs-text" style="margin:24px 0 8px;font-size:18px;line-height:26px;font-weight:700;color:#111827">What happens next</h2>
<ul class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;padding:0 0 0 24px;color:#111827;font-size:16px;line-height:24px"><li style="margin:0 0 8px">Store data fixes are written through Shopify&#39;s Admin API. Rampsmith then re-scans the affected pages to verify them.</li>
<li style="margin:0 0 8px">Code fixes go to your developer as a pull request. Rampsmith verifies them after it is merged.</li>
</ul>
<p class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#111827">The remediation log records who approved each fix, and when.</p>
<p style="margin:24px 0"><a class="rs-button" href="https://admin.shopify.com/store/fixture-store/apps/rampsmith/fixes" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#1d4ed8;border:2px solid #1d4ed8;border-radius:6px;color:#ffffff;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:24px;padding:10px 20px;text-decoration:none">Review fixes</a></p>
</div>
